# ARCHITECTURAL INVARIANTS

Do not change these without explicit architectural approval:

1. One Organization per database.
2. No cross-Organization relationships.
3. School → Academic Year → Branch → Class → Section → Student hierarchy.
4. RBAC + ABAC.
5. FastAPI JWT authentication/authorization boundary.
6. Organization-level subject master.
7. Historical academic preservation.
8. Selective rowversion.
9. Migration-controlled schema evolution.
10. No speculative procedures/triggers/jobs.

If a requested feature conflicts with an invariant, stop and ask.
